  "title": "Process or Slurm job?",
  "story": "Before the weekend, clean up two things of yours. Your Slurm job {{job}} is still running and holding a GPU. And `plot_scores.py`, which you ran straight from the command line, is still going. Each one needs a different command. mlee is running a plot_scores.py too; leave theirs alone.",
